1
00:01:04,599 --> 00:01:06,120
Search carefully.

2
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:07,810
Don't miss a single corner.

3
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:16,360
Something feels wrong.

4
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:19,600
They must have alerted the enemy,

5
00:01:19,600 --> 00:01:21,200
and let Qian Yanqing escape.

6
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:22,680
Could it be that the three of them

7
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:24,140
distracted us on purpose?

8
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:26,810
What are you talking about?

9
00:01:27,080 --> 00:01:27,720
Wrap it up.

10
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:32,000
Why does this sachet look familiar?

11
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:34,280
Li Chengrui didn't catch Qian Yanqing

12
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:36,440
and went back to the police station.

13
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:39,400
How are we going to investigate next?

14
00:01:40,880 --> 00:01:43,240
If it's an organized trafficking of women,

15
00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:44,360
we must find

16
00:01:44,360 --> 00:01:45,759
the criminals' lair.

17
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,539
I'm good at disguises.

18
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:48,460
I'll go.

19
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:49,400
No.

20
00:01:49,720 --> 00:01:50,440
Senior Sister,

21
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:51,640
let me go.

22
00:01:51,720 --> 00:01:53,120
I'm about the same age as Lingling.

23
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:54,640
I should be their target.

24
00:01:55,039 --> 00:01:56,160
I'll be the bait

25
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:57,400
and infiltrate the criminal ring.

26
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:59,200
No, it's too dangerous.

27
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:00,040
Yeah.

28
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:01,680
I have other plans for you two.

29
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:02,240
Shi'an.

30
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:04,130
You guys follow me then.

31
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:05,360
I'll leave clues for you.

32
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:05,880
Siyao.

33
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,520
Didn't you say I suspected you?

34
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:08,400
Now,

35
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:10,039
I'm trusting you with my life.

36
00:02:10,039 --> 00:02:10,840
Okay.

37
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:57,000
Officer,

38
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,600
please save my daughter.

39
00:02:58,720 --> 00:03:00,800
She's only sixteen.

40
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:02,680
Your police department is too inefficient.

41
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:04,080
It's been three days since we reported it.

42
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,400
Why haven't you handled it yet?

43
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:06,720
If you don't give us an explanation today,

44
00:03:06,720 --> 00:03:08,200
we're not leaving.

45
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:10,280
We need time to investigate.

46
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:13,280
Seriously, why are you guys like this?

47
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:13,960
Yes, yes.

48
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:15,520
It's already being handled.

49
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:16,840
This is bad.

50
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:17,640
What's wrong?

51
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:20,240
More and more girls are going missing.

52
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:22,240
The parents who reported it have surrounded the police station.

53
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:23,800
It's a complete mess outside.

54
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:24,960
Then go handle it quickly.

55
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:26,960
What's the use of complaining to me?

56
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:28,520
In the past, in situations like this,

57
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:30,000
Inspector Jiang would always step in.

58
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:30,400
I...

59
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:32,120
You are just a piece of trash.

60
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,000
L-Lord Huo.

61
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:36,600
Lord Huo.

62
00:03:36,720 --> 00:03:37,400
Why are you here?

63
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,440
You should have let me know.

64
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:39,900
I would have picked you up.

65
00:03:42,640 --> 00:03:44,840
My Huo residence is quite lively today.

66
00:03:45,079 --> 00:03:46,079
So many citizens

67
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:48,400
want me to seek justice for them.

68
00:03:48,720 --> 00:03:50,520
Look at the streets now.

69
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:53,440
People are already petitioning.

70
00:03:58,200 --> 00:03:59,400
Li Chengrui,

71
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:01,680
are you completely useless?

72
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:03,800
Do I need to call Mayor Zeng

73
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:04,960
and have you replaced?

74
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:05,760
No, no, no.

75
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:07,320
It's already being resolved.

76
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:09,720
Hurry up and get Detective Jiang back.

77
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,280
Um,

78
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:12,690
Officer Huo.

79
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:16,079
Please ask Detective Jiang to make an appearance.

80
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:17,920
Detective Jiang is missing.

81
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:19,800
I even think

82
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:21,980
you did this, Superintendent Li.

83
00:04:22,760 --> 00:04:24,120
How is that possible?

84
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:24,720
No.

85
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:26,400
Detective Jiang and I

86
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:28,320
just have different ideas about handling cases.

87
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:29,960
How could I harm her?

88
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:31,840
Yao Qiang, don't just stand there.

89
00:04:31,840 --> 00:04:32,440
Go, go, go.

90
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:33,760
Hurry up and find her.

91
00:04:33,760 --> 00:04:34,420
Go quickly.

92
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:35,220
Right away.

93
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:36,560
Go quickly.

94
00:04:42,440 --> 00:04:43,440
My lady.

95
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:45,360
Did I do okay just now?

96
00:04:45,640 --> 00:04:47,000
Li Chengrui's words

97
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:48,760
are credible.

98
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,360
In my opinion,

99
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:53,800
this matter should have nothing to do with him.

100
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:54,659
Think about it.

101
00:04:55,159 --> 00:04:56,880
If Jiang Siyao solves the case,

102
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:59,409
Li Chengrui will just wait to take the credit.

103
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:01,640
So he needs Jiang Siyao.

104
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:04,080
Nothing ventured, nothing gained.

105
00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:05,600
I think Jiang Siyao

106
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:08,060
has already entered the tiger's den.

107
00:05:30,520 --> 00:05:32,240
What are you guys doing?

108
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:33,320
You...

109
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:35,930
Why are you wearing clothes like this?

110
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:38,360
This is a school uniform.

111
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:39,890
The school makes us wear it.

112
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:41,000
Then you...

113
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:43,620
Why do you go to a Westerner's school?

114
00:05:44,760 --> 00:05:45,760
Schools...

115
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:49,040
Schools are of course for learning knowledge.

116
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:49,680
Nonsense!

117
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,920
Do you know

118
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:57,600
that all Western things

119
00:05:58,880 --> 00:06:00,140
are foreign religions

120
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:02,040
used to bewitch people's minds

121
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,720
and corrupt human bodies?

122
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:06,200
Using Westerners' things

123
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:08,480
and learning Westerners' knowledge,

124
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:09,810
sooner or later you will

125
00:06:09,880 --> 00:06:11,540
become slaves to Westerners,

126
00:06:11,760 --> 00:06:14,840
and after death you will surely fall into the Avici Hell.

127
00:06:14,840 --> 00:06:16,040
How is that possible?

128
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:17,880
Schools are for increasing knowledge

129
00:06:17,880 --> 00:06:19,040
and enlightening the people.

130
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:20,700
Worshipping foreign things,

131
00:06:20,760 --> 00:06:22,000
straying from the righteous path.

132
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:22,520
Punish!

133
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:28,240
What are you doing?

134
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,560
Why are you hitting me?

135
00:06:29,880 --> 00:06:31,840
Help! Help!

136
00:06:31,840 --> 00:06:34,400
Only Lord Jumang can save you

137
00:06:34,400 --> 00:06:35,760
and save the world.

138
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:39,240
May you soon hear the true voice

139
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:41,640
and wash away your sins.

140
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:44,480
New disciple,

141
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:47,240
quickly kneel and worship Lord Jumang.

142
00:06:47,520 --> 00:06:48,520
I won't kneel.

143
00:06:48,520 --> 00:06:49,040
Stubborn and foolish.

144
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:49,720
I absolutely will not kneel.

145
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:50,980
Blaspheming the Lord.

146
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,440
Come, get up.

147
00:07:09,640 --> 00:07:11,480
Since you have worshipped the Lord,

148
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:14,120
you are now an official disciple of the Jingxiang Society.

149
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:15,050
Your Dharma name

150
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:16,200
will be Jingxin.

151
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:18,600
Jingzhi,

152
00:07:18,840 --> 00:07:21,040
she will cultivate with you from now on.

153
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,320
Yes, Venerable.

154
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:26,900
Senior Sister,

155
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:28,570
how long have you been here?

156
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:30,690
How many people are in here?

157
00:07:31,320 --> 00:07:32,000
From now on,

158
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:33,370
you will sleep here.

159
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:37,720
No, I...

160
00:07:40,080 --> 00:07:41,080
I'm sleeping here?

161
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:42,480
All these clothes of yours,

162
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,810
we will throw them away.

163
00:07:43,880 --> 00:07:44,280
But...

164
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:44,840
Here,

165
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:46,500
you can only wear this.

166
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:49,770
Just these ragged clothes?

167
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:53,000
You...

168
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:57,120
From now on,

169
00:07:57,200 --> 00:07:59,130
no foreign items are allowed here.

170
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:00,720
Otherwise, you will be punished.

171
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:01,360
Got it?

172
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:02,440
Let's go.

173
00:08:04,440 --> 00:08:05,400
Reporting to Superintendent Li.

174
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:06,160
I spent the whole day

175
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:07,560
checking people entering and leaving the city.

176
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:09,160
I didn't find anything suspicious.

177
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:10,120
I checked all the streets

178
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:11,800
and brothels in the city,

179
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,160
but found no clues about Detective Jiang.

180
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:14,360
Did you go to investigate a case

181
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,600
or visit brothels?

182
00:08:15,880 --> 00:08:17,080
How could the kidnappers

183
00:08:17,080 --> 00:08:19,210
hide someone in such an obvious place?

184
00:08:20,200 --> 00:08:21,080
You mean...

185
00:08:21,640 --> 00:08:23,400
Hurry up and find him!

186
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:24,400
Yes, sir.

187
00:08:32,280 --> 00:08:34,000
Why didn't you tell me you were here?

188
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:34,760
You're finally back.

189
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:35,679
Any news?

190
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:37,520
I sent many people to look for him,

191
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:38,840
but they couldn't find him.

192
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:40,799
So many people and still nothing?

193
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:44,960
Eliminate all foreign influence.

194
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:48,520
Restore our traditions

195
00:08:48,760 --> 00:08:52,040
and keep our hearts pure.

196
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:53,360
Start with me.

197
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:55,840
Start with me.

198
00:08:56,040 --> 00:08:57,400
Please,

199
00:08:57,600 --> 00:09:00,440
help me find my daughter, Detective Jiang.

200
00:09:02,360 --> 00:09:03,280
Lingling.

201
00:09:08,280 --> 00:09:10,800
Every meal is hard-earned.

202
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:12,960
They are all bestowed by the Heavenly Lord.

203
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:14,000
Do not waste them.

204
00:09:14,160 --> 00:09:15,000
Let's eat.

205
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:21,880
Lingling.

206
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,240
Lingling.

207
00:09:23,880 --> 00:09:24,680
Don't be afraid.

208
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:25,810
I'm here to save you.

209
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:31,040
How is it?

210
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,290
Did you find her?

211
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:34,720
Young Master.

212
00:09:34,760 --> 00:09:35,840
As you instructed,

213
00:09:36,040 --> 00:09:37,200
we used all our connections

214
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:39,040
to look for places where girls gather.

215
00:09:39,040 --> 00:09:39,700
Currently,

216
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:40,780
there are no clues.

217
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:44,120
What about checking the carriages entering and leaving the city?

218
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:46,000
There is a village that is quite strange.

219
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:47,440
It was originally a poor village,

220
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:49,760
but recently carriages have been coming and going frequently.

221
00:09:49,760 --> 00:09:50,840
I checked,

222
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:52,560
and there are no new industries.

223
00:09:52,560 --> 00:09:54,080
That's all the information I have.

224
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:54,440
Okay.

225
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:55,970
I'll go check it out.

226
00:09:56,160 --> 00:09:56,760
You go look for her.

227
00:09:56,760 --> 00:09:57,600
Time waits for no one.

228
00:09:57,600 --> 00:10:00,160
The later we find Siyao, the more danger she will be in.

229
00:10:00,160 --> 00:10:00,760
By the way,

230
00:10:00,800 --> 00:10:02,660
here is what you asked me to bring.

231
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:06,600
Let's go.

232
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,420
Who is this person?

233
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:12,680
A distant relative of mine.

234
00:10:12,680 --> 00:10:14,080
He asked me to get him a residence permit.

235
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:15,560
I have already sent the Huo family

236
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:16,800
to expand the search area.

237
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:18,080
They've gone outside the city.

238
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:19,320
Do you have any news?

239
00:10:19,680 --> 00:10:20,640
Baxian Village.

240
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:23,200
Lingling,

241
00:10:23,200 --> 00:10:24,600
do you know where this is?

242
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:27,840
How many people are here?

243
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:29,840
There is one Venerable,

244
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:31,200
three Masters,

245
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:33,240
and about a dozen Protectors.

246
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:34,800
The rest

247
00:10:34,800 --> 00:10:36,460
are female disciples like us,

248
00:10:36,640 --> 00:10:38,400
about twenty or thirty people.

249
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:39,340
The Venerable,

250
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:40,800
is he the boss here?

251
00:10:40,880 --> 00:10:42,560
There seems to be a Grandmaster as well.

252
00:10:42,560 --> 00:10:44,760
I just got here and haven't seen him yet.

253
00:10:45,680 --> 00:10:46,740
Jingxin, Jingyan,

254
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,880
you two have violated the rules.

255
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:51,600
No lunch for you today.

256
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:26,640
Moxa floss.
